      "originalText": "* please make sure you create route tables, routes and subnet associations according to the architecture diagram.\n⁠* please make sure you create security groups and associations to instances according to architecture diagram.\n⁠* please make sure you create security rules according to the instructions.\n⁠* Do Not Use any terraform modules. please use terraform AWS resources individually.",
