      "originalText": "{\"type\":\"excalidraw/clipboard\",\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1e6NeGi3DKbRSwK76mGRM\",\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":272.29934527283604,\"y\":4321.349566916747,\"width\":1506.5916760735338,\"height\":105,\"angle\":0,\"strokeColor\":\"#2f9e44\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#a5d8ff\",\"fillStyle\":\"cross-hatch\",\"strokeWidth\":4,\"strokeStyle\":\"solid\",\"roughness\":0,\"opacity\":100,\"groupIds\":[],\"frameId\":null,\"index\":\"b7J\",\"roundness\":null,\"seed\":131616162,\"version\":2918,\"versionNonce\":1103836578,\"isDeleted\":false,\"boundElements\":[],\"updated\":1756329716124,\"link\":null,\"locked\":false,\"text\":\"AWS + HashiCorp's Recommendation \\n* Use separate `aws_vpc_security_group_ingress_rule` and `aws_vpc_security_group_egress_rule`\\nresources, and reference to `aws_security_group`\",\"fontSize\":28,\"fontFamily\":8,\"textAlign\":\"left\",\"verticalAlign\":\"top\",\"containerId\":null,\"originalText\":\"AWS + HashiCorp's Recommendation \\n* Use separate `aws_vpc_security_group_ingress_rule` and `aws_vpc_security_group_egress_rule` resources, and reference to `aws_security_group`\",\"autoResize\":false,\"lineHeight\":1.25}],\"files\":{}}",
