      "text": "# Route table for Hub VPC (receives traffic from spokes)\nresource \"aws_ec2_transit_gateway_route_table\" \"hub_rtb\" {\n  transit_gateway_id = aws_ec2_transit_gateway.main_tgw.id\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = \"hub-tgw-route-table\"\n  }\n}\n\n# Route table for Spoke VPCs (sends traffic to hub)\nresource \"aws_ec2_transit_gateway_route_table\" \"spoke_rtb\" {\n  transit_gateway_id = aws_ec2_transit_gateway.main_tgw.id\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = \"spoke-tgw-route-table\"\n  }\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# Route table for Hub VPC (receives traffic from spokes)\nresource \"aws_ec2_transit_gateway_route_table\" \"hub_rtb\" {\n  transit_gateway_id = aws_ec2_transit_gateway.main_tgw.id\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = \"hub-tgw-route-table\"\n  }\n}\n\n# Route table for Spoke VPCs (sends traffic to hub)\nresource \"aws_ec2_transit_gateway_route_table\" \"spoke_rtb\" {\n  transit_gateway_id = aws_ec2_transit_gateway.main_tgw.id\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = \"spoke-tgw-route-table\"\n  }\n}",
