      "text": "Inbound Rules\n* Allow `bastion-sg security group` to access port 8080 of internal-server\n\n* Allow `bastion-sg security group` to be able to SSH to internal-server\n\n",
      "fontSize": 26.40674927734301,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Inbound Rules\n* Allow `bastion-sg security group` to access port 8080 of internal-server\n\n* Allow `bastion-sg security group` to be able to SSH to internal-server\n\n",
