      "text": "# Option 1 - Update ~/.ssh/config\nHost ec2jump\n  HostName 18.141.100.15\n  User ec2-user\n  IdentityFile /Users/sai.linnthu/ssh-portforwarding-demo/sshkey.pem\n\nHost ubuntupriv\n  HostName 10.0.253.48\n  User ubuntu\n  IdentityFile /Users/sai.linnthu/ssh-portforwarding-demo/sshkey.pem\n  ProxyJump ec2jump",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# Option 1 - Update ~/.ssh/config\nHost ec2jump\n  HostName 18.141.100.15\n  User ec2-user\n  IdentityFile /Users/sai.linnthu/ssh-portforwarding-demo/sshkey.pem\n\nHost ubuntupriv\n  HostName 10.0.253.48\n  User ubuntu\n  IdentityFile /Users/sai.linnthu/ssh-portforwarding-demo/sshkey.pem\n  ProxyJump ec2jump",
