    {
      "id": "hlDCVj0ujgj9_akQdJv3o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -725.2550382551026,
      "y": 7461.455157183107,
      "width": 3253.53564453125,
      "height": 497.7812638852726,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 865229679,
      "version": 541,
      "versionNonce": 2133527261,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1758954064636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. The main agent (949) registers the instance and listens for AWS requests.\n\n2. For a Run Command, it tasks the agent worker (1236) to execute the script.\n\n3. For a Session Manager connection, it spawns a session worker (4391) to handle your interactive shell.\n\n4. All processes communicate securely with the AWS SSM service over HTTPS.",
      "fontSize": 56.88928730117401,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. The main agent (949) registers the instance and listens for AWS requests.\n\n2. For a Run Command, it tasks the agent worker (1236) to execute the script.\n\n3. For a Session Manager connection, it spawns a session worker (4391) to handle your interactive shell.\n\n4. All processes communicate securely with the AWS SSM service over HTTPS.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eq3koxLzbVj6YmMqkLpF4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1261.9720756911092,
      "y": 8149.798996591417,
      "width": 3034.54736328125,
      "height": 355.55804563233755,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 515052943,
      "version": 591,
      "versionNonce": 1745304033,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757423904266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "amazon-ssm-agent (The core agent daemon)\n* Registers the instance with AWS Systems Manager.\n* Heartbeats/pings the SSM service to maintain status (\"Online\").\n* Listens for incoming commands from AWS (e.g., Run Command, State Manager, Maintenance Windows).\n* Orchestrates the creation of child processes for specific tasks.",
      "fontSize": 56.88928730117401,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "amazon-ssm-agent (The core agent daemon)\n* Registers the instance with AWS Systems Manager.\n* Heartbeats/pings the SSM service to maintain status (\"Online\").\n* Listens for incoming commands from AWS (e.g., Run Command, State Manager, Maintenance Windows).\n* Orchestrates the creation of child processes for specific tasks.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "othehR0EfITLvEhqxHCCa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1266.536681853323,
      "y": 8665.605409426329,
      "width": 1626.767822265625,
      "height": 355.55804563233755,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1979157423,
      "version": 696,
      "versionNonce": 1168594369,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757423904266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ssm-agent-worker (A persistent background worker)\n* Handles the execution of non-interactive SSM tasks\n* Running AWS-RunShellScript commands.\n* Processing State Manager associations.\n* Handling Maintenance Window tasks.",
      "fontSize": 56.88928730117401,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ssm-agent-worker (A persistent background worker)\n* Handles the execution of non-interactive SSM tasks\n* Running AWS-RunShellScript commands.\n* Processing State Manager associations.\n* Handling Maintenance Window tasks.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LMpnsBPY0I5CVSeBJguBE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1273.6068989096684,
      "y": 9180.39960673236,
      "width": 3065.8310546875,
      "height": 355.55804563233755,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bQo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1971862991,
      "version": 778,
      "versionNonce": 1419310497,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757423904266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ssm-session-worker (A session-specific worker for interactive Session Manager sessions.)\n* Is spawned only when you start an interactive session (via aws ssm start-session).\n* Manages the secure communication channel between your local client and the AWS instance's shell.\n* Terminates automatically when you type exit in the session.\n* The argument sai.linnthu@hashicorp.com-q8bs2z3glucx2vrxhnj6y54gpu is the unique Session ID.",
      "fontSize": 56.88928730117401,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ssm-session-worker (A session-specific worker for interactive Session Manager sessions.)\n* Is spawned only when you start an interactive session (via aws ssm start-session).\n* Manages the secure communication channel between your local client and the AWS instance's shell.\n* Terminates automatically when you type exit in the session.\n* The argument sai.linnthu@hashicorp.com-q8bs2z3glucx2vrxhnj6y54gpu is the unique Session ID.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
