      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note:\nWhen you use the hostname ec2-13-250-199-229.ap-southeast-1.compute.amazonaws.com, \nyour hub instance's DNS server (10.0.0.2) is resolving it to the private IP address (192.168.1.28) \ninstead of the public IP (13.250.199.229).\n\nAWS's internal DNS resolver prioritizes private IP addresses when instances have VPC peering established, \nregardless of whether they are in the same region or different regions.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note:\nWhen you use the hostname ec2-13-250-199-229.ap-southeast-1.compute.amazonaws.com, \nyour hub instance's DNS server (10.0.0.2) is resolving it to the private IP address (192.168.1.28) \ninstead of the public IP (13.250.199.229).\n\nAWS's internal DNS resolver prioritizes private IP addresses when instances have VPC peering established, \nregardless of whether they are in the same region or different regions.",
